<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score on the</p>
<p>opening day in the Supersport series cricket match on Sunday</p>
<p>between Transvaal and Border in East London:</p>
<p>Transvaal 228-8 (Ross Veenstra 90 not out, Andrew Hall 78,</p>
<p>Piet Botha 4-28)</p>
</text>
